---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice of ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: publisher, host, liability`} description="Publisher, publication director and host of this sales tax and property tax calculator, the limits of an estimate, intellectual property, embedding terms and the governing law." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information given under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 (the publisher is established in France).</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>An estimate, not advice</h2>
    <p>The calculators apply the statewide rates and rules published by each state, the local rate you enter, and Census Bureau statistics. They are not tax, legal or accounting advice. Whether a sale is taxable, which local rate applies at an address and what a property owes are decided by the seller's state, the local jurisdictions and the county assessor. The site is independent of all of them. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>method page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2><p>Facts are re-read at their sources and the engines are tested at every release, without any guarantee that no error remains. The publisher is not liable for a decision taken on an estimate alone. Report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Texts, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link are welcome. Census Bureau data are public domain works of the U.S. government.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The sales tax calculator may be embedded free of charge with its credit link visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>The site sets no cookie and the publisher records no personal data; stability is monitored anonymously, without cookies, with Microsoft Clarity. Details in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and on the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Unlawful content</h2><p>Report it to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the address of the page.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law; failing an amicable settlement, the courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
